# Homelab — Docker only

On **homelab** (`~/doorman`), Doorman runs **entirely in Docker**. Do not add or document
host-level app setup outside that boundary.

**Deploy shape:** Mac `rsync worker/` → `~/doorman`, then remote `docker compose build/up`.
Secrets in `~/doorman/.env` only (never rsync'd; created from `.env.example` on first deploy).
Host installs **platform only** (NVIDIA driver, Docker, Container Toolkit) — not app Python.

Worker runs as the container default user (root), same as tasmi-asr — no `user:` override, no
host `chown`, no UID mapping.

## Do

- `bun run deploy` from Mac (rsync code + `docker compose build/up` on homelab)
- `docker compose up|build|logs|ps|exec` in `~/doorman` — not host `curl` to `:8768`
- One-off GPU tasks via `docker compose run` or `docker run --gpus all` with the worker image
- Secrets and tuning in `~/doorman/.env` (never rsync'd from Mac)

**Host surface:** only `~/doorman/.env`, bind-mounted `db/`, and `docker` / `docker compose`.
No host `curl`, Python, or app binaries for operations — health and logs via compose.

## Do not

- Install Python, venv, `pip install -r requirements-vision.txt`, or apt packages on the homelab
  **host** for Doorman
- Run `enroll.py` / `main.py` with homelab host `python3.11` or `~/doorman/.venv`
- Suggest `ssh homelab 'sudo chown …'` or other host mutations outside Docker
- Add systemd units, cron, or bare-metal services for the worker — use `compose.yaml`

## Mac vs homelab

| Task                       | Mac          | Homelab     |
| -------------------------- | ------------ | ----------- |
| Edit, pytest, lint         | ✓            | —           |
| InsightFace / GPU          | —            | Docker only |
| Enrollment photos          | —            | web UI (`/enroll`) |
| Prod worker (`/recognize`) | —            | Docker only |
